abstract: "Machine learning experiment predicting wet months in Vienna using historical monthly weather observations from the Hohe Warte station. The repository contains DBRepo-based data loading, semantic and unit metadata mappings, SQL view definitions, machine learning training and evaluation code, and FAIR documentation artefacts."

